{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"title":"GrafluentCollections","externalID":"GrafluentCollections","modules":[{"name":"GrafluentCollections"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","symbolKind":"module"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GrafluentCollections\/documentation\/GrafluentCollections"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Graph-shaped collections for Swift: search trees, tries, suffix structures and decision diagrams"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with value semantics, built on Grafluent."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every collection is a copy-on-write struct with the API shape of the standard library’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"collections and Swift Collections. Where a structure is a tree or a graph, it also converts to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Grafluent type of that shape (","type":"text"},{"code":"BinaryTree","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Arborescence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"RootedTree","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), so Grafluent’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"algorithms and drawings run over it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"import GrafluentCollections","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" imports every module. Each module also has its own documentation and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can be imported on its own."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import GrafluentCollections","","var scores: FenwickTree = [3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6]","print(scores.prefixSum(through: 3))  \/\/ 9","print(scores.sum(in: 2 ..< 6))       \/\/ 19"]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfa